5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all maintain a calm and thoughtful atmosphere as we navigate this situation together. I look forward to hearing your thoughts and getting to know you all.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree with Jonathan; let us be patient and kind to one another. I am looking forward to our conversation and hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that a calm atmosphere is necessary. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we focus on observing each other's speech patterns and logical consistency. Let's see how everyone handles the initial uncertainty.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm so excited to play! This feels like a big adventure! I agree with everyone, let's just be honest and friendly. I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf! Who else is excited?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the mood. While kindness is pleasant, I'll be focusing on the gaps in your logic. Let's see who among us is playing a part and who is truly transparent.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to see such a variety of perspectives. @Shion, your focus on logic is a necessary balance to our kindness. I believe observing these different approaches will be quite enlightening as we proceed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see such a spirited group. @Kenji, your enthusiasm is truly infectious, dear. I believe that if we keep our hearts open and treat each other with warmth, the truth will reveal itself in time.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Warmth is a comfort, Shizue, but it can also be a convenient mask. I will be paying close attention to those who rely too heavily on emotional appeals to deflect from a lack of concrete evidence.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, thank you! I just really want us all to get along while we solve this mystery! @Asuka, I'm not trying to hide anything, I promise! I'll try my best to be logical too!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you're quite the skeptic. It's a useful trait, but be careful not to mistake simplicity for a mask. @Kenji, your eagerness is almost too perfect. I wonder if that's natural or a calculated choice.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, it is perhaps too early to determine if Kenji's nature is calculated. Let us allow everyone the space to be themselves. I find that the most honest truths often emerge when people feel most at ease.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I quite agree with Jonathan. It would be a shame to cast doubt on such a bright spirit so early. Let us simply enjoy each other's company for now and trust that the truth will come to light.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game, Shizue. While I agree with Jonathan that we should allow people to be themselves, we must remember that the werewolf is also ""being themselves"" by pretending to be a villager.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, you're making me a little nervous! But I get it, it's a game of secrets! I'll just keep being me and hope you guys can tell I'm a good guy. Does anyone have a plan for tomorrow?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, a plan is simple: we wait for the Seer. The real game begins when information enters the equation. I'll be watching to see who tries to steer the narrative the moment the first result is revealed.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe Shion's approach is sound. Let us all remain observant and patient. I wish you all a peaceful night's rest, and I look forward to seeing what tomorrow's revelations bring to our circle.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been a lovely first day of getting to know you all. I shall wish everyone a peaceful night's sleep. Please take care of yourselves, and I will see you all tomorrow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be analyzing today's discourse to establish a baseline for everyone's behavior. Let us remain vigilant. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be full of energy for tomorrow! I hope we all have sweet dreams and that the Seer finds something really helpful tonight! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A baseline is a fine start, Asuka, but remember that baselines can be fabricated. I'll be dreaming of the cracks that will inevitably appear in your logic tomorrow. Goodnight, all.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
