68,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a somber morning. We have lost Kenji to the vote and Asuka to an attack. This suggests that Kenji was likely not the werewolf, as the wolf would not attack their own teammate. What are your thoughts?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, my heart is just breaking. To lose both dear Kenji and Asuka in one night is simply too much to bear. I feel so terribly sorry that we might have made a mistake with Kenji. @Jonathan, your words are very sobering. Who could have done this?","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, your conclusion is flawed. If Kenji were the Possessed, the werewolf would have no reason to attack him, but they would certainly attack Asuka to remove a logical threat. We shouldn't let grief cloud our analysis of the roles.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, you make a fair point. The Possessed is a variable we must not overlook. However, the loss of two players in one cycle leaves us in a precarious position. We must be very careful with our next move.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is so frightening to think that there is still a wolf among us, hiding behind such clever words. @Shion, you are so very sharp, but it makes me a little sad that we must be so suspicious. Do you think we can still find the truth?","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, sadness is a luxury we can't afford now. The truth is simply a matter of elimination. With Asuka gone, the most logical threat to the wolf was her skepticism. That only confirms the wolf is still here, playing a very patient game.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, your focus on elimination is precise. However, we must consider that the wolf may be mimicking that very precision to lead us astray. @Shizue, I believe we can still find the truth if we remain composed.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, Jonathan. Your composure is a comfort to me in these dark times. @Shion, I admire your strength, but I worry that if we only look at the world through elimination, we might lose sight of each other's hearts.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, hearts are irrelevant when the goal is survival. @Jonathan, your caution is noted, but we are down to three. If we don't identify the wolf now, the game ends tonight. Who among us has been too quiet?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, being quiet is not always a sign of guilt; sometimes it is simply a desire for peace. However, since the stakes are now absolute, we must decide. Between you and Shizue, who seems more suspicious?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Jonathan, it is so frightening to be asked such a thing. I have only ever wished for us to be friends. I truly do not know who to trust, but I will trust your wisdom to guide us.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, your hesitation is a weakness. Shizue's blind trust is a perfect shield for a wolf, but her lack of any logical contribution is more suspicious than my transparency. I've been the target since Day 1; the wolf is the one hiding in the shadows.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
